{"1783740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Essence Of The Tjikko - Prologue", "steam_appid": 1783740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>REMASTERED EDITION - FEBRUARY 2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 4 years of development, Essence Of The Tjikko returns completely rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's new in the remaster:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced graphics - Improved lighting, textures and post-processing<br>- New UI system - Better readability and visual feedback<br>- Extended seasonal fruit system - New visual effects and refined mechanics<br>- 50+ bug fixes and improvements<br>- Performance optimization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released on February 22nd, the day after Zelda's 40th anniversary - a tribute to the 3D dungeons that inspired this botanical adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover mysteries in an old-school 3D Zelda-like dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb walls, move objects, perceive the invisible with your ether vision. You are a plant-child hybrid with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're at the bottom of a 7-floor botanical laboratory. To reach daylight, traverse 30+ rooms filled with puzzles, strange mechanisms and botanical secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform with seasonal fruits:<br>- Spring - Water bouncing<br>- Summer - Blazing speed<br>- Autumn - Ethereal vision<br>- Winter - Frosted jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fruit changes your abilities and appearance. Experiment to discover new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue takes 1-2 hours to complete. Self-contained episode, first part of a larger adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Like a sprout, upward is the only way!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/f33f991e64917f7f264bca37f7aeb40b.poster.avif?t=1781536374\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/f33f991e64917f7f264bca37f7aeb40b.webm?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/f33f991e64917f7f264bca37f7aeb40b.mp4?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍃 <strong>Transform with seasonal fruits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four fruits change your abilities AND appearance:<br>- Spring - Water bouncing<br>- Summer - Blazing speed<br>- Autumn - Ethereal vision<br>- Winter - Frosted jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the hero on their quest to understand their origins and the bonds they share with other plants. They react around them and the hero can sense the ether flowing. Their health is also their stamina, so take care of it like a fragile bud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/6ad6f10831cf535160afc4cac6e9fa40.poster.avif?t=1781536374\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/6ad6f10831cf535160afc4cac6e9fa40.webm?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/6ad6f10831cf535160afc4cac6e9fa40.mp4?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧗 <strong>Explore a 7-floor vertical dungeon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dungeon hides many secrets. Use your abilities to spot them and head for the exit. Climb walls, move objects, use your ether vision to reveal the invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path is the right one, and you might find rewards around any corner. 30+ interconnected rooms await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/608147981bacc1e70242e1e7c87e2395.poster.avif?t=1781536374\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/608147981bacc1e70242e1e7c87e2395.webm?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/608147981bacc1e70242e1e7c87e2395.mp4?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔬 <strong>An enigmatic botanical laboratory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants can have strange shapes, but this laboratory has very strange ones. Computers, doors, cable cars, bridges, chairs... You'll explore a vast cabinet of curiosities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand how each mechanism works to progress. Technology and botany blend in this abandoned environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/ba6572b7948b9aa05919716b86c572b1.poster.avif?t=1781536374\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/ba6572b7948b9aa05919716b86c572b1.webm?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783740/extras/ba6572b7948b9aa05919716b86c572b1.mp4?t=1781536374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A love letter to early 2000s 3D games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With low-fidelity textures and clean 3D models, this game pays homage to early 2000s 3D adventures (PS2, GameCube). Nostalgia doesn't recreate the past, but can enchant the present...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Ocarina of Time and Twilight Princess, Essence Of The Tjikko captures the essence of those memorable dungeons while bringing a unique botanical twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>✓ 7-floor vertical dungeon, 30+ unique rooms<br>✓ 4 seasonal fruits transforming your abilities and appearance<br>✓ Climbing, object manipulation, ether vision<br>✓ Environmental physics puzzles<br>✓ Retro early 2000s aesthetic (PS2, GameCube)<br>✓ 11 Steam achievements<br>✓ Full controller support (recommended)<br>✓ Available in 10 languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Philippe Reinhart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimu